		~FGKTPrimSee				0		 17		   0		 0		   15		 13~
		//Stats to Dual Class from	MIN_STR | MIN_DEX | MIN_CON | MIN_INT | MIN_WIS | MIN_CHR
		~FGKTPrimSee				0		 15		   0		 0		   13		 11~
